  "note": "Annual election of one-third of the Donaghadee Urban Council, January 1929. Four candidates were nominated for the four vacancies and there was no contest (Belfast News-Letter, 7 January 1929, p. 12). No poll: four nominations for four seats. The three other retiring members were Messrs. Wm. Curragh, James T. Stronge, J.P., and George L. Delacherois, J.P. The third name is as printed. Returned unopposed."
